{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>And I appeared.</b> To the fathers." "<b>As El Shaddai.</b> I promised them promises, and in all of them I said to them: I am El Shaddai." "<b>But My name YHWH — I did not make myself known to them.</b> It is not written לֹא הוֹדַעְתִּי, 'I did not make known,' but rather לֹא נוֹדַעְתִּי — 'I was not known.' I was not recognized by them in the attribute of My truthfulness, for which My name YHWH is called: faithful to fulfill My words — for I promised them and did not fulfill."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:50:44.011855753Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}